{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.39","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80070,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e2b92128c0c4fa3e811bc07ca8e97db","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This isn&#039;t DW related but all of you brides were so helpful to me in my own wedding planning process I thought I would post this here to get some advice. One of my Maids of Honour just got engaged a couple of weeks ago! I&#039;m so so excited for her and I&#039;m right back into wedding planning mode but from the other side. She&#039;s having a fairly short engagement (setting a date for Oct or Nov 2016). This means I&#039;m planning a shower for July and bachelorette party for Sept...not a lot of time!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I would love to hear about all of your showers and parties and what you loved about them! I&#039;m trying to get some creative ideas and what better place than this amazing forum!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Right now we&#039;re thinking of \"Brunch n&#039; Bubbly\" bridal shower in the summer.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any creative ideas for gift themes for the bride? My shower was all lingerie type gifts so I would like to do something a bit different.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any creative ideas for the favours for the guests? My girls gave everyone mini succulents - they were a big hit!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For the bachelorette, we&#039;re probably getting a small group of us (myself and another very close friend and her sister and sisters in law) and going away for a weekend in Montreal or Quebec City.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;All ideas welcome! Thanks ladies! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913249,"PostDate":1462170360,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This isn't DW related but all of you brides were so helpful to me in my own wedding planning process I thought I would post this here to get some advice. One of my Maids of Honour just got engaged a couple of weeks ago! I'm so so excited for her and I'm right back into wedding planning mode but from the other side. She's having a fairly short engagement (setting a date for Oct or Nov 2016). This means I'm planning a shower for July and bachelorette party for Sept...not a lot of time!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I would love to hear about all of your showers and parties and what you loved about them! I'm trying to get some creative ideas and what better place than this amazing forum!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Right now we're thinking of \"Brunch n' Bubbly\" bridal shower in the summer.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any creative ideas for gift themes for the bride? My shower was all lingerie type gifts so I would like to do something a bit different.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any creative ideas for the favours for the guests? My girls gave everyone mini succulents - they were a big hit!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For the bachelorette, we're probably getting a small group of us (myself and another very close friend and her sister and sisters in law) and going away for a weekend in Montreal or Quebec City.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>All ideas welcome! Thanks ladies! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415551111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.88.50.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80070,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a51756ef3a25a3b61896a3a6df10e675","RawContent":"My girls did a brunch and bubbly theme for my shower and I loved it.\n\n\nMimosa Bar -\n\n\n\n\nBrunch Spread -\n\n\n\n\nCookie Favours - \n\n\n\n\nDecor -\n\n\n\n\nSince I had a registry there was no gift theme. I&#039;ve heard of a \"gift card theme\" which may sound silly but my girlfriend just gave us a list of places she would shop for things, places that don&#039;t offer registries, and this way she got literally everything she wanted and it&#039;s easier for guests. Personal preference really. \n\n\nAs much as I love games, I don&#039;t love being the centre of attention. The girls had organized the bead game - steal each other&#039;s beads if someone says X, X or X - they asked my fianc\u00e9 a bunch of questions and I had to answer them - and they had a list of 20 \"life events\"; some silly some memorable, and the guest that got them in the most correct order won a prize. Prizes were mini bottles of champagne with cute strays attached. \n\n\nI&#039;ll share some bachelorette ideas after mine on Saturday :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1913299,"PostDate":1462339644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My girls did a brunch and bubbly theme for my shower and I loved it.<br><br>\nMimosa Bar -<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913299]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-282006-0-49193700-1462335459.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  79.88KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-282006-0-49193700-1462335459.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nBrunch Spread -<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913299]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-282006-0-17408200-1462335496.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  104.75KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-282006-0-17408200-1462335496.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nCookie Favours - <br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913299]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-282006-0-55030200-1462335544.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  76.92KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-282006-0-55030200-1462335544.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nDecor -<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1913299]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-282006-0-39886600-1462335591.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  83.65KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2016\/post-282006-0-39886600-1462335591.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nSince I had a registry there was no gift theme. I've heard of a \"gift card theme\" which may sound silly but my girlfriend just gave us a list of places she would shop for things, places that don't offer registries, and this way she got literally everything she wanted and it's easier for guests. Personal preference really. <br><br>\nAs much as I love games, I don't love being the centre of attention. The girls had organized the bead game - steal each other's beads if someone says X, X or X - they asked my fianc\u00e9 a bunch of questions and I had to answer them - and they had a list of 20 \"life events\"; some silly some memorable, and the guest that got them in the most correct order won a prize. Prizes were mini bottles of champagne with cute strays attached. <br><br>\nI'll share some bachelorette ideas after mine on Saturday <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Ashley<br><br>My Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\u00a0<\/p><div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div><div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ecf1\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div><div><\/a><\/div>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1423108661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.53.254.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80070,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13829ea7b314974befb4d734b89ffbf8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"ashhtayy\"] this is great!!! thanks so much for sharing Ashley!&amp;nbsp; :) Can&#039;t wait to hear about your bachelorette!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913326,"PostDate":1462398219,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282006\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url f